	<key>readme</key>
	<string>This workflow fires a digital confetti cannon across your screen. Use when you need to celebrate a quick win!

Configuration Variables:
- DURATION: How long the confetti stays on screen in seconds (Default: 5.0)
- PARTICLE_COUNT: Density of the confetti (Default: 14)
- THEME: Color palette to use. Options: standard, two bit, neon, pastel, and monochrome (Default: standard)

© 2026 Jake Fowler / [Two Bit Consulting](https://twobit-consulting.com). MIT Licensed.</string>
